==============================================================================
Support-2 weight enumerator A_2 and the anti-MDS signature
==============================================================================
 Every pair of nonzero offsets admits a support-2 relation over Q, but the
 CODE-relevant coefficient is #pairs with a SHORT primitive relation
 min(|a|,|b|)<=R (these carry the largest Fourier kernel ~1/(ab)).

